{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Driveloop</strong> is a high-octane, 3D survivor-like shooter in post-apocalyptic cities. Experience intense tactical driving and explosive combat as you upgrade and customize your vehicle to survive relentless enemy waves. Navigate real-world-inspired environments filled with danger at every turn. It\u2019s survival of the fastest. Are you ready to take the wheel?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183730/extras/4cdd64adb3f0a6a1e36691f80b4755b4.avif?t=1772444690\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183730/extras_big/4cdd64adb3f0a6a1e36691f80b4755b4.avif?t=1772444690 width=800 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183730/extras/9c50dd364a6dff85f19364136f14ba23.poster.avif?t=1772444690\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183730/extras/9c50dd364a6dff85f19364136f14ba23.webm?t=1772444690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183730/extras/9c50dd364a6dff85f19364136f14ba23.mp4?t=1772444690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Navigate chaotic battlegrounds and tear through endless hordes of steampunk-inspired enemies. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift, ram and unleash a barrage of firepower as you experience an intense combination of tactical driving and explosive combat. Explore decaying cities inspired by real-world metropolis where danger lurks at every street corner. Whether you\u2019re charging into the swarms, evading enemy fire, or unleashing devastating attacks, embrace the chaos in style. It\u2019s survival of the fastest and strongest!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183730/extras/6f553e261084159fb57f3b288b7fd1f1.poster.avif?t=1772444690\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183730/extras/6f553e261084159fb57f3b288b7fd1f1.webm?t=1772444690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183730/extras/6f553e261084159fb57f3b288b7fd1f1.mp4?t=1772444690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mastering the art of drifting and ramming is essential to survive.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gain the edge in the heat of battle by ramming through enemies to open up new avenues of attack and maintain your speed with carefully timed drifts! Your vehicle is both a deadly weapon and a resilient shield in this fast-paced battleground.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183730/extras/b82c6d67d34898feb4b9c712cc2d63e8.poster.avif?t=1772444690\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183730/extras/b82c6d67d34898feb4b9c712cc2d63e8.webm?t=1772444690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183730/extras/b82c6d67d34898feb4b9c712cc2d63e8.mp4?t=1772444690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Outmaneuvre, outgun and outlast your enemies with quick thinking and strategic decision-making.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Recruit a motley crew of specialists to give your suped-up joyride more powerful weaponry and collect spare parts to unlock devastating power-ups. Build effective synergies to turn yourself into an unstoppable combat vehicle!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183730/extras/33d9b0b986ecf5fe0a08c12f4ca14636.poster.avif?t=1772444690\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183730/extras/33d9b0b986ecf5fe0a08c12f4ca14636.webm?t=1772444690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183730/extras/33d9b0b986ecf5fe0a08c12f4ca14636.mp4?t=1772444690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Driveloop thrusts you into post-apocalyptic cityscapes inspired by real-world locations.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > From the desolate ruins of Berlin to the crumbling boulevards of Paris, each environment offers unique challenges and challenging layouts to overcome. Every street corner is a potential battlefield, and every turn could be your last.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183730/extras/4cdd64adb3f0a6a1e36691f80b4755b4.avif?t=1772444690\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183730/extras_big/4cdd64adb3f0a6a1e36691f80b4755b4.avif?t=1772444690 width=800 height=115 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Octane Combat</strong>: drift, ram, and blast through endless waves of steampunk enemies in intense, chaotic battles.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultimate Vehicle Customization</strong>: upgrade with powerful weapons, unique crew members, and strategic abilities to enhance combat potential.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Post-Apocalyptic Cityscapes</strong>: explore beautifully decayed, art-deco-inspired takes on iconic real-world cities.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relentless Enemy Variety</strong>: face diverse enemy types, from swarming minions to heavily armored mechanical foes.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Encounters</strong>: confront massive, tactical bosses requiring precise timing and strategic use of vehicle abilities.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Progression</strong>: continuously unlock synergies and expand your combat power with each upgrade and crew addition.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Arsenal Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183730/60964b1e583c86991b7cb88ff29ef37f068b995d.jpg"},{"name":"Weapon Initiate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183730/d5db29abc764739bea602a7a90446a8bf3aadc0f.jpg"},{"name":"Rebounder Unlocked","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183730/18eaa29c6cc1293791def9be2f46260c7a71777c.jpg"},{"name":"Linebreaker Unlocked","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183730/78b1f4ce4451c682e72e2997bab1505aa9d71422.jpg"},{"name":"Nullstorm Unlocked","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183730/a22bc4b9529200ca291ddb4e3e9d1c24ee71a75b.jpg"},{"name":"Shockburst Unlocked","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183730/63fbb20f5d11c32138170ffe12c04c4048891d74.jpg"},{"name":"Maxed Weapon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183730/4ac77464cd8d55afc5693f7cc560ad38960115c5.jpg"},{"name":"Max Ironwind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183730/c291844a5b805321c53ba0f0d71ff1d7d36fbb7d.jpg"},{"name":"Max Rebounder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183730/8b0d52d2511902d508c4c2de7e80eb19c25ee9da.jpg"},{"name":"Max Linebreaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183730/d02717aaa5723bbd44415d38b1ae4f7c47b2fa21.jpg"}],"total":60},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3183730?t=1772444690","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183730/4e551b07450b8cd4d0d94e518fe6dc6e54fff59b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772444690","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183730/9deb07f3893a143ac0afd58d9518fe46522edbf2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772444690","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183730/9deb07f3893a143ac0afd58d9518fe46522edbf2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772444690","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN US!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183730/extras/818ba16a0c179e5092e827ed7e80b9bd.avif?t=1772444690\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class