apps/3183730/extras_big/4cdd64adb3f0a6a1e36691f80b4755b4.avif?t=1772444690 width=800 height=115 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Octane Combat</strong>: drift, ram, and blast through endless waves of steampunk enemies in intense, chaotic battles.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultimate Vehicle Customization</strong>: upgrade with powerful weapons, unique crew members, and strategic abilities to enhance combat potential.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Post-Apocalyptic Cityscapes</strong>: explore beautifully decayed, art-deco-inspired takes on iconic real-world cities.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relentless Enemy Variety</strong>: face diverse enemy types, from swarming minions to heavily armored mechanical foes.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Encounters</strong>: confront massive, tactical bosses requiring precise timing and strategic use of vehicle abilities.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Progression</strong>: continuously unlock synergies and expand your combat power with each upgrade and crew addition.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Stunbyte"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183730/edb4be5dcc80212a891d3331e5651a9e5adb5f8d/header.jpg?t=1772444690","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS 3.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4590 or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</stron